.SH VERSION HISTORY
.PP
New features and important modifications of \f[B]vsearch\f[R]
(short-lived or minor bug releases may not be mentioned):
.TP
\f[B]v1.0.0\f[R] released November 28th, 2014
First public release.
.TP
\f[B]v1.0.1\f[R] released December 1st, 2014
Bug fixes (sortbysize, semicolon after size annotation in headers) and
minor changes (labels as secondary sort key for most sorts, treat T and
U as identical for dereplication, only output size in
\f[V]--dbmatched\f[R] file if \f[V]--sizeout\f[R] specified).
.TP
\f[B]v1.0.2\f[R] released December 6th, 2014
Bug fixes (ssse3/sse4.1 requirement, memory leak).
.TP
\f[B]v1.0.3\f[R] released December 6th, 2014
Bug fix (now writes help to stdout instead of stderr).
.TP
\f[B]v1.0.4\f[R] released December 8th, 2014
Added \f[V]--allpairs_global\f[R] option.
Reduce memory requirements slightly and eliminate memory leaks.
.TP
\f[B]v1.0.5\f[R] released December 9th, 2014
Fixes a minor bug with \f[V]--allpairs_global\f[R] and
\f[V]--acceptall\f[R] options.
.TP
\f[B]v1.0.6\f[R] released December 14th, 2014
Fixes a memory allocation bug in chimera detection
(\f[V]--uchime_ref\f[R] option).
.TP
\f[B]v1.0.7\f[R] released December 19th, 2014
Fixes a bug in the output from chimera detection with the
\f[V]--uchimeout\f[R] option.
.TP
\f[B]v1.0.8\f[R] released January 22nd, 2015
Introduces several changes and bug fixes:
.RS
.IP \[bu] 2
a new linear memory aligner for alignment of sequences longer than 5,000
nucleotides,
.IP \[bu] 2
a new \f[V]--cluster_size\f[R] command that sorts sequences by
decreasing abundance before clustering,
.IP \[bu] 2
meaning of userfields qlo, qhi, tlo, thi changed for compatibility with
usearch,
.IP \[bu] 2
new userfields qilo, qihi, tilo, tihi give alignment coordinates
ignoring terminal gaps,
.IP \[bu] 2
in \f[V]--uc\f[R] output files, a perfect alignment is indicated with a
\f[V]=\f[R] sign,
.IP \[bu] 2
the option \f[V]--cluster_fast\f[R] now sorts sequences by decreasing
length, then by decreasing abundance and finally by sequence identifier,
.IP \[bu] 2
default \f[V]--maxseqlength\f[R] value set to 50,000 nucleotides,
.IP \[bu] 2
fix for bug in alignment in rare cases,
.IP \[bu] 2
fix for lack of detection of under- or overflow in SIMD aligner.
.RE
.TP
\f[B]v1.0.9\f[R] released January 22nd, 2015
Fixes a bug in the function sorting sequences by decreasing abundance
(\f[V]--sortbysize\f[R]).
.TP
\f[B]v1.0.10\f[R] released January 23rd, 2015
Fixes a bug where the \f[V]--sizein\f[R] option was ignored and always
treated as on, affecting clustering and dereplication commands.
.TP
\f[B]v1.0.11\f[R] released February 5th, 2015
Introduces the possibility to output results in SAM format (for
clustering, pairwise alignment and searching).
.TP
\f[B]v1.0.12\f[R] released February 6th, 2015
Temporarily fixes a problem with long headers in FASTA files.
.TP
\f[B]v1.0.13\f[R] released February 17th, 2015
Fix a memory allocation problem when computing multiple sequence
alignments with the \f[V]--msaout\f[R] and \f[V]--consout\f[R] options,
as well as a memory leak.
Also increased line buffer for reading FASTA files to 4MB.
.TP
\f[B]v1.0.14\f[R] released February 17th, 2015
Fix a bug where the multiple alignment and consensus sequence computed
after clustering ignored the strand of the sequences.
Also decreased size of line buffer for reading FASTA files to 1MB again
due to excessive stack memory usage.
.TP
\f[B]v1.0.15\f[R] released February 18th, 2015
Fix bug in calculation of identity metric between sequences when using
the MBL definition (\f[V]--iddef 3\f[R]).
.TP
\f[B]v1.0.16\f[R] released February 19th, 2015
Integrated patches from Debian for increased compatibility with various
architectures.
.TP
\f[B]v1.1.0\f[R] released February 20th, 2015
Added the \f[V]--quiet\f[R] option to suppress all output to stdout and
stderr except for warnings and fatal errors.
Added the \f[V]--log\f[R] option to write messages to a log file.
.TP
\f[B]v1.1.1\f[R] released February 20th, 2015
Added info about \f[V]--log\f[R] and \f[V]--quiet\f[R] options to help
text.
.TP
\f[B]v1.1.2\f[R] released March 18th, 2015
Fix bug with large datasets.
Fix format of help info.
.TP
\f[B]v1.1.3\f[R] released March 18th, 2015
Fix more bugs with large datasets.
.TP
\f[B]v1.2.0\[en]v1.2.19\f[R] released July 6th to September 8th, 2015
Several new commands and options added.
Bugs fixed.
Documentation updated.
.TP
\f[B]v1.3.0\f[R] released September 9th, 2015
Changed to autotools build system.
.TP
\f[B]v1.3.1\f[R] released September 14th, 2015
Several new commands and options.
Bug fixes.
.TP
\f[B]v1.3.2\f[R] released September 15th, 2015
Fixed memory leaks.
Added \f[V]-h\f[R] shortcut for help.
Removed extra \f[V]v\f[R] in version number.
.TP
\f[B]v1.3.3\f[R] released September 15th, 2015
Fixed bug in hexadecimal digits of MD5 and SHA1 digests.
Added \f[V]--samheader\f[R] option.
.TP
\f[B]v1.3.4\f[R] released September 16th, 2015
Fixed compilation problems with zlib and bzip2lib.
.TP
\f[B]v1.3.5\f[R] released September 17th, 2015
Minor configuration/makefile changes to compile to native CPU and
simplify makefile.
.TP
\f[B]v1.4.0\f[R] released September 25th, 2015
Added \f[V]--sizeorder\f[R] option.
.TP
\f[B]v1.4.1\f[R] released September 29th, 2015
Inserted public domain MD5 and SHA1 code to eliminate dependency on
crypto and openssl libraries and their licensing issues.
.TP
\f[B]v1.4.2\f[R] released October 2nd, 2015
Dynamic loading of libraries for reading gzip and bzip2 compressed files
if available.
Circumvention of missing gzoffset function in zlib 1.2.3 and earlier.
.TP
\f[B]v1.4.3\f[R] released October 3rd, 2015
Fix a bug with determining amount of memory on some versions of Apple OS
X.
.TP
\f[B]v1.4.4\f[R] released October 3rd, 2015
Remove debug message.
.TP
\f[B]v1.4.5\f[R] released October 6th, 2015
Fix memory allocation bug when reading long FASTA sequences.
.TP
\f[B]v1.4.6\f[R] released October 6th, 2015
Fix subtle bug in SIMD alignment code that reduced accuracy.
.TP
\f[B]v1.4.7\f[R] released October 7th, 2015
Fixes a problem with searching for or clustering sequences with repeats.
In this new version, vsearch looks at all words occurring at least once
in the sequences in the initial step.
Previously only words occurring exactly once were considered.
In addition, vsearch now requires at least 10 words to be shared by the
sequences, previously only 6 were required.
If the query contains less than 10 words, all words must be present for
a match.
This change seems to lead to slightly reduced recall, but somewhat
increased precision, ending up with slightly improved overall accuracy.
.TP
\f[B]v1.5.0\f[R] released October 7th, 2015
Introduces the new option \f[V]--minwordmatches\f[R] that allows the
user to specify the minimum number of matching unique words before a
sequence is considered further.
New default values for different word lengths are also set.
The minimum word length is increased to 7.
.TP
\f[B]v1.6.0\f[R] released October 9th, 2015
Adds the relabeling options (\f[V]--relabel\f[R],
\f[V]--relabel_md5\f[R] and \f[V]--relabel_sha1\f[R]) to the shuffle
command.
Also adds the \f[V]--xsize\f[R] option to the clustering, dereplication,
shuffling and sorting commands.
.TP
\f[B]v1.6.1\f[R] released October 14th, 2015
Fix bugs and update manual and help text regarding relabelling.
Add all relabelling options to the subsampling command.
Add the \f[V]--xsize\f[R] option to chimera detection, dereplication and
fastq filtering commands.
Refactoring of code.
.TP
\f[B]v1.7.0\f[R] released October 14th, 2015
Add \f[V]--relabel_keep\f[R] option.
.TP
\f[B]v1.8.0\f[R] released October 19th, 2015
Added \f[V]--search_exact\f[R], \f[V]--fastx_mask\f[R] and
\f[V]--fastq_convert\f[R] commands.
Changed most commands to read FASTQ input files as well as FASTA files.
Modified \f[V]--fastx_revcomp\f[R] and \f[V]--fastx_subsample\f[R] to
write FASTQ files.
.TP
\f[B]v1.8.1\f[R] released November 2nd, 2015
Fixes for compatibility with QIIME and older OS X versions.
.TP
\f[B]v1.9.0\f[R] released November 12th, 2015
Added the \f[V]--fastq_mergepairs\f[R] command and associated options.
This command has not been tested well yet.
Included additional files to avoid dependency of autoconf for
compilation.
Fixed an error where identifiers in fasta headers were not truncated at
tabs, just spaces.
Fixed a bug in detection of the file format (FASTA/FASTQ) of a gzip
compressed input file.
.TP
\f[B]v1.9.1\f[R] released November 13th, 2015
Fixed memory leak and a bug in score computation in
\f[V]--fastq_mergepairs\f[R], and improved speed.
.TP
\f[B]v1.9.2\f[R] released November 17th, 2015
Fixed a bug in the computation of some values with
\f[V]--fastq_stats\f[R].
.TP
\f[B]v1.9.3\f[R] released November 19th, 2015
Workaround for missing x86intrin.h with old compilers.
.TP
\f[B]v1.9.4\f[R] released December 3rd, 2015
Fixed incrementation of counter when relabeling dereplicated sequences.
.TP
